  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table lists the 17 recommendations of the 2021 WHO guidelines on systematic screening for TB disease, grouped into screening in targeted populations (1–8) and tools for screening (9–17). Each recommendation is followed by its status (new, updated or existing), its strength and the certainty of the evidence.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
